OL,3,ABurnham says united Ireland poll is
OL,4,A'off the table' during first NI visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has ruled
OL,7,Fout calling a referendum on Irish
OL,8,Funification, describing a border poll
OL,9,Fas "off the table".
OL,11,FThe Labour leader said votes on Brexit
OL,12,Fand Scottish independence showed the
OL,13,F"risks that come from those situations
OL,14,Ftake a long time to heal".
OL,16,FSpeaking during his first official
OL,17,Fvisit to Northern Ireland, he said the
OL,18,Ffocus should instead be on public
OL,19,Fservices and tackling cost-of-living
OL,20,Fpressures.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
